# 2 — Custody & Supply Chain

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Origin[Origin Record] --> Package[Packaged Artifact]
  Package --> Transfer[Transfer Event]
  Transfer --> Repository[Repository / Distributor]
  Repository --> Recipient[Recipient]
  Recipient --> Custody[Custody Evidence]
```

Record each transfer with artifact identity, SHA-256, signature where available, timestamp, actor, declared location, and transaction/reference identifier.

Aptitude uses **U.S. custody** as a factual evidence category: a record may establish that a particular actor, facility, transaction, or repository was located in or governed by a U.S.-related commercial context when evidence supports it. It does not by itself establish government ownership, federal certification, or exclusive U.S. origin.
